# CHANGELOG.md is generated by git-cliff, and .github/workflows/changelog.yml
# fails any PR where the committed file differs byte-for-byte from what
# `git-cliff -o CHANGELOG.md` produces. Prettier re-wraps the header prose,
# which breaks that check on every PR regardless of content. Leave it alone.
CHANGELOG.md

# docz owns the index tables and ToCs in these files and rewrites them on every
# `docz update`. Prettier re-aligns the table pipes and pads the generated
# blocks, so the two tools undo each other on every run. markdownlint is the
# gate here (.github/workflows/docs.yml), and it passes on docz's own output.
docs/*/README.md

# Build output
build/
dist/
